WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.210 --> 00:00:02.790
This is just genuinely terrible news.

00:00:02.790 --> 00:00:07.279
The state of New York has decided to cancel
the Democratic presidential primary, which

00:00:07.279 --> 00:00:11.160
they had rescheduled to June 23rd because
of Corona virus.

00:00:11.160 --> 00:00:12.990
And you might be wondering, why is it terrible?

00:00:12.990 --> 00:00:16.660
Either way, Joe Biden is going to be the Democratic
nominee.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:19.070
It has everything to do with Donald Trump.

00:00:19.070 --> 00:00:24.119
We already suspect that Donald Trump is likely
to try funny business in November.

00:00:24.119 --> 00:00:27.689
We don't know exactly what the funny business
will be, but there are a number of different

00:00:27.689 --> 00:00:29.939
things that he is likely to try.

00:00:29.939 --> 00:00:36.809
Why would Democrats do anything that could
be seen as any kind of precedent for funny

00:00:36.809 --> 00:00:38.350
business in November?

00:00:38.350 --> 00:00:43.340
And I know many of you will say, listen, David,
canceling a primary when there is only one

00:00:43.340 --> 00:00:49.519
candidate remaining is very different than
canceling or postponing a highly contested

00:00:49.519 --> 00:00:50.860
presidential election.

00:00:50.860 --> 00:00:53.600
And you would be correct that they are not
the same thing.

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:57.290
But this is Donald Trump that we're talking
about, Donald Trump, who's already been playing

00:00:57.290 --> 00:01:01.420
up, that the Democrats are stealing it from
Bernie Sanders.

00:01:01.420 --> 00:01:06.000
Donald Trump, who complains to this day about
an election that he won.

00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:07.619
He says the results were wrong.

00:01:07.619 --> 00:01:10.630
He won in 2016 electorally.

00:01:10.630 --> 00:01:18.240
So this is something that could only embolden
Trump in opposing vote by mail in November

00:01:18.240 --> 00:01:24.280
in who knows what other ideas Trump might
have and would be emboldened.

00:01:24.280 --> 00:01:28.250
And now Trump can say, listen, everything's
different this time around.

00:01:28.250 --> 00:01:31.110
Look at what Democrats did in New York.

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:35.610
What New York should have done is say we're
going to do the election.

00:01:35.610 --> 00:01:36.869
One hundred percent by mail.

00:01:36.869 --> 00:01:40.560
It'll be a 100 percent absentee ballot election.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:43.810
There are two months to set this up, minus
a few days.

00:01:43.810 --> 00:01:44.880
This can be done.

00:01:44.880 --> 00:01:48.110
It would help to make the case that the election
in November must go on.

00:01:48.110 --> 00:01:49.110
But by mail.

00:01:49.110 --> 00:01:51.659
So New York is doing the exact opposite of
what they should be doing.

00:01:51.659 --> 00:01:56.369
New York could foment the case for vote by
mail in November by doing it themselves and

00:01:56.369 --> 00:01:58.020
saying, look, we said it, we did it, we set
it up.

00:01:58.020 --> 00:02:01.780
We're not normally a vote by mail state, but
we were able to do it.

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:05.670
Instead, they are canceling an election altogether.

00:02:05.670 --> 00:02:07.729
And you're doing two things when you do this.

00:02:07.729 --> 00:02:12.200
Number one, you are enraging the Bernie or
Busters and there's something to be said about

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.270
that.

00:02:13.270 --> 00:02:17.100
Although the degree to which this will impact
whether they ultimately vote for Joe Biden

00:02:17.100 --> 00:02:18.900
in November, I don't know.

00:02:18.900 --> 00:02:23.650
But number two, you're giving Trump something
to point to if he ends up saying, hey, let's

00:02:23.650 --> 00:02:25.690
delay the November election.

00:02:25.690 --> 00:02:26.690
That's it.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:27.690
Trump can't do that unilaterally.

00:02:27.690 --> 00:02:31.420
Remember, it's up to states to delay or not
delay elections.

00:02:31.420 --> 00:02:36.760
But Trump could say, please do it or you give
Trump the opportunity to push against vote

00:02:36.760 --> 00:02:41.790
by mail by saying, listen, if it were so easy
and logical to do vote by mail, why didn't

00:02:41.790 --> 00:02:43.040
New York do it?

00:02:43.040 --> 00:02:45.230
They canceled the primary.

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:46.710
Clearly vote by mail.

00:02:46.710 --> 00:02:48.680
Isn't that easy to do?

00:02:48.680 --> 00:02:54.250
So these are all very good questions and it
all gives Trump cover for funny business.

00:02:54.250 --> 00:02:59.050
Now, I know some of you are going to write
to me and you're going to say many states

00:02:59.050 --> 00:03:02.300
canceled Republican primaries over the virus.

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:07.330
The point is Trump can't really use that in
November to try to pull funny business.

00:03:07.330 --> 00:03:13.510
A Democratic primary being canceled altogether
opens the door to be misused and abused by

00:03:13.510 --> 00:03:14.510
Donald Trump.

00:03:14.510 --> 00:03:16.580
Now, here's the crazy thing.

00:03:16.580 --> 00:03:19.930
There are still going to be down ballot elections
in New York on June 23rd.

00:03:19.930 --> 00:03:25.850
According to The New York Times, polling places
are expected to remain open in 42 counties

00:03:25.850 --> 00:03:32.110
in New York State, four down ballot races,
and you will be able to obtain absentee ballots

00:03:32.110 --> 00:03:33.660
to vote in those.

00:03:33.660 --> 00:03:39.120
So much of New York state is still having
an election on June 23rd.

00:03:39.120 --> 00:03:41.610
But they've eliminated the Democratic primary.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:45.120
Obviously, Biden was going to win the New
York Democratic primary.

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:50.030
Obviously, the outcome of the primary overall
was not going to change with or without New

00:03:50.030 --> 00:03:51.290
York voting.

00:03:51.290 --> 00:03:55.990
But you're still holding an election for other
downballot races and you are giving Trump

00:03:55.990 --> 00:03:58.090
something he can potentially use.

00:03:58.090 --> 00:03:59.900
I think it's a very bad idea.

00:03:59.900 --> 00:04:02.110
I think this is the wrong decision being made
by New York.

00:04:02.110 --> 00:04:08.420
Do you disagree with me?

00:04:08.420 --> 00:04:24.800
Let me know it

